100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Waghodia GIDC</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Por-Ramangamdi GIDC</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Gotri</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Karelibaug</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Manjalpur</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Sama-Savli Road</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Vasna Road</a> <a class=\"city-card bg-gray-100 text-center p-3 rounded-lg font-medium text-gray-700 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:text-white\" href=\"#\">Old Padra Road</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- FAQ Section -->\r\n<section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\r\n<h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl md:text-4xl text-center mb-12\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm mb-4\"><details open=\"open\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center\">What brands of panel ACs do you service besides Rittal? <i class=\"fas fa-plus transform transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">While we are specialists in <b class=\"keyword-bold\">Rittal panel AC service</b>, our certified technicians are also trained to repair and maintain panel coolers from other major brands like Schneider, Siemens, and Hoffman.</div>\r\n</details></div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm mb-4\"><details open=\"open\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center\">Is regular maintenance necessary for a Rittal panel AC? <i class=\"fas fa-plus transform transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Absolutely. Regular maintenance, like our <b class=\"keyword-bold\">Rittal AC AMC (Annual Maintenance Contract)</b>, is crucial to ensure optimal performance, prevent unexpected breakdowns, and extend the lifespan of your unit, protecting your valuable control panel equipment.</div>\r\n</details></div>\r\n<div class=\"faq-item bg-white p-4 rounded-lg shadow-sm mb-4\"><details open=\"open\">\r\n<summary class=\"font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center\">Do you also provide <b class=\"keyword-bold\">Rittal AC installation service</b>? <i class=\"fas fa-plus transform transition-transform\"></i></summary>\r\n<div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide complete <b class=\"keyword-bold\">Rittal AC installation service</b>. Our team ensures the unit is installed correctly according to manufacturer specifications for maximum efficiency and reliability.</div>\r\n</details></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Final CTA Section -->\r\n<section class=\"bg-gray-800 text-white py-20\">\r\n<div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\r\n<h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Production Halted? Don&#8217;t Wait.</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-yellow-300 mb-8\">Get immediate <b class=\"keyword-bold\">24/7 Rittal panel AC repair</b> from the experts at Atlas Aircon.</p>\r\n<a class=\"cta-button text-white font-bold py-4 px-10 rounded-full text-xl inline-block\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> <i class=\"fas fa-phone mr-3\"></i>Call Us Now for Emergency Service </a></div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main><!-- Popup Container -->\r\n<div id=\"popup-overlay\" class=\"popup-overlay\">\r\n<div class=\"popup-content\"><span id=\"popup-close\" class=\"popup-close\">×</span>\r\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-4\">Get a Free Quote Instantly!</h2>\r\n<p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-6\">Facing an issue? Let our experts help you now.</p>\r\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"POST\">\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\" for=\"popup-name\">Name</label> <input id=\"popup-name\" class=\"w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md py-2 px-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-500\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Your Name\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-4\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\" for=\"popup-phone\">Phone Number</label> <input id=\"popup-phone\" class=\"w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md py-2 px-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-500\" type=\"tel\" placeholder=\"Your Phone Number\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"mb-6\"><label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\" for=\"popup-service\">Service Needed</label> <input id=\"popup-service\" class=\"w-full border border-gray-300 rounded-md py-2 px-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-yellow-500\" type=\"text\" value=\"Rittal Panel AC Repair\" /></div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-3\"><a class=\"w-full cta-button text-white text-center font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-md inline-flex items-center justify-center\" href=\"tel:+919727257141\"> <i class=\"fas fa-phone mr-2\"></i> Call Now </a> <a class=\"w-full bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white text-center font-bold py-3 px-4 rounded-md inline-flex items-center justify-center\" href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp mr-2\"></i> WhatsApp Us </a></div>\r\n</form></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Minimized Quote Icon -->\r\n<div id=\"minimized-icon\" class=\"minimized-quote-icon\"> </div>\r\n<p><script>\r\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\r\n        // FAQ Accordion Logic\r\n        const detailsElements = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item details');\r\n        detailsElements.forEach(detail => {\r\n            detail.addEventListener('toggle', (event) => {\r\n                const summary = event.target.querySelector('summary');\r\n                const icon = summary.querySelector('i');\r\n                if (event.target.open) {\r\n                    icon.classList.remove('fa-plus');\r\n                    icon.classList.add('fa-minus');\r\n                } else {\r\n                    icon.classList.remove('fa-minus');\r\n                    icon.classList.add('fa-plus');\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        // Popup Logic\r\n        const popupOverlay = document.getElementById('popup-overlay');\r\n        const closeButton = document.getElementById('popup-close');\r\n        const minimizedIcon = document.getElementById('minimized-icon');\r\n\r\n        const openPopup = () => {\r\n            if (popupOverlay) popupOverlay.classList.add('active');\r\n            if (minimizedIcon) minimizedIcon.classList.remove('active');\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        const closePopup = () => {\r\n            if (popupOverlay) popupOverlay.classList.remove('active');\r\n            if (minimizedIcon) minimizedIcon.classList.add('active');\r\n        };\r\n\r\n        // Show popup after a delay, only once per session\r\n        if (!sessionStorage.getItem('popupShown')) {\r\n            setTimeout(() => {\r\n                openPopup();\r\n                sessionStorage.setItem('popupShown', 'true');\r\n            }, 60000); // 60 seconds\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        // Event listeners\r\n        if (closeButton) closeButton.addEventListener('click', closePopup);\r\n        \r\n        if (minimizedIcon) {\r\n            minimizedIcon.addEventListener('click', openPopup);\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if (popupOverlay) {\r\n            popupOverlay.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\r\n                if (e.target === popupOverlay) {\r\n                    closePopup();\r\n                }\r\n            });\r\n        }\r\n    });\r\n</script></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n",
